<title>UK: All three Brent cargoes kept - trade.</title>
<headline>All three Brent cargoes kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>All three Brent cargoes due to turn wet on Thursday were kept from the paper chains ahead of the five o'clock deadline, trading sources said.</p>
<p>The cargoes, due to load Sept 27-29, were kept by Wall Street trader J.P. Morgan, they added.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
